      "text": "As a filmmaker, I love how you structured the narrative around the paradox of \"Bhinneka Tunggal Ika\" (Unity in Diversity) [04:38]. Highlighting that the world's largest matriarchal society (the Minangkabau) [07:46] thrives within the world's largest Muslim-majority nation is a brilliant way to break global stereotypes. With a median age of 30 and the 8th largest economy by purchasing power [24:14], this video proves Indonesia isn't just a postcard; it's an awakening giant. Great video! 🌋📈",
